---

<BaseLayout
    title={pageTitle}
    description={pageDescription}
>
    <!-- Structured JSON-LD Schema Graph -->
    <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(pageSchema)} />

    <main class="dcrs-service-page">

        <!-- 1. HERO / OPENING ------------------------------------------------>
        <header class="dcrs-hero-banner">
            <div class="dcrs-hero-banner__scrim"></div>
            <div class="dcrs-container dcrs-hero-banner__inner">
                <nav class="dcrs-breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
                    <ol>
                        <li><a href="/">Home</a></li>
                        <li><a href="/#service">Services</a></li>
                        <li aria-current="page">Car AC Repair Dubai</li>
                    </ol>
                </nav>
                <span class="dcrs-badge">Al Satwa, Dubai · AC Repair &amp; Gas Refill · All Makes &amp; Models</span>
                <h1 class="dcrs-hero-banner__title">
                    Car AC Repair Dubai - Gas Refill, Compressor &amp; Leak Fix
                </h1>
                <p class="dcrs-hero-banner__lead">
                    Car AC repair in Dubai helps restore proper cooling when your vehicle's air conditioning system starts blowing warm air, loses cooling efficiency, or develops unusual noises or odours. Dubai Car Repair Service provides car AC inspection, gas refilling, leak detection, and component repairs for different vehicle makes and models. Visit our Al Satwa workshop for professional AC servicing and diagnostics. Our technicians inspect the system to identify the cause of the problem before recommending suitable repairs.
                </p>
                <div class="dcrs-hero-banner__actions">
                    <a href={phoneHref} class="dcrs-btn dcrs-btn--solid">
                        <Fragment set:html={icons.phone} /> Call {phoneDisplay}
                    </a>
                    <a href={waHref} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="dcrs-btn dcrs-btn--wa">
                        <Fragment set:html={icons.chat} /> WhatsApp Us
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </header>

        <!-- 2. SERVICE OVERVIEW ---------------------------------------------->
        <section class="dcrs-section dcrs-section--paper" id="service-overview">
            <div class="dcrs-container">
                <div class="dcrs-grid-2col dcrs-grid-2col--align-center">
                    
                    <div class="dcrs-intro-content">
                        <div class="dcrs-kicker">Service Overview</div>
                        <h2 class="dcrs-heading__title">
                            Car AC Repair Dubai - Fast Diagnostics &amp; Complete Cooling Fixes
                        </h2>
                        <p class="dcrs-lead-text">
                            During Dubai's long summer months, automotive air conditioning systems operate under intense thermal stress. High ambient temperatures exceeding 45°C combined with engine heat create extreme under-hood operating conditions. Over time, heat cycling and continuous operation can cause refrigerant seals to harden, dust to restrict condenser airflow, and mechanical components to wear down, leading to reduced cooling efficiency or warm air from your vents.
                        </p>
                        <p class="dcrs-body-text">
                            When an air conditioner blows warm air, simply refilling refrigerant gas without testing the system often provides only short-lived cooling. If an active leak exists in the lines, condenser, or evaporator, new refrigerant will escape quickly, while moisture entering the system can cause internal damage. A professional inspection checks system pressures and uses electronic leak detectors and UV dye to identify the exact cause before recharging refrigerant. When engine overheating affects AC performance, our workshop also inspects the cooling fan and provides <a href="/car-engine-service-dubai" class="dcrs-inline-link">engine cooling system repair</a> alongside routine <a href="/car-maintenance-dubai" class="dcrs-inline-link">car maintenance services</a>.
                        </p>
                        <p class="dcrs-body-text">
                            Dubai Car Repair Service provides comprehensive AC inspections, precision gas refilling, and component replacements for Japanese, European, American, and Korean vehicles. Most comprehensive diagnostics and repairs are performed at our Al Satwa workshop, where dedicated recovery stations are installed, while basic diagnostic assessments and top-ups can also be arranged through our <a href="/mobile-car-repair-dubai" class="dcrs-inline-link">mobile car repair service</a>. We provide clear, itemized estimates so you understand the condition of your AC system before any work begins.
                        </p>

                        <div class="dcrs-action-row">
                            <a href={phoneHref} class="dcrs-btn dcrs-btn--solid">
                                <Fragment set:html={icons.phone} /> Call Workshop
                            </a>
                            <a href="/contact" class="dcrs-btn dcrs-btn--outline-ink">
                                Book Inspection <Fragment set:html={icons.arrowRight} />
                            </a>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="dcrs-intro-media">
                        <div class="dcrs-intro-media__frame">
                            <img
                                src={service6Image.src}
                                alt="Technician testing refrigerant pressure during car AC repair in Dubai at Al Satwa garage"
                                loading="eager"
                                width="600"
                                height="400"
                            />
                            <div class="dcrs-plate dcrs-price-badge" aria-hidden="true">
                                <div class="dcrs-plate__tab">AED</div>
                                <div class="dcrs-plate__body">
                                    <span class="dcrs-plate__row dcrs-plate__row--big">100+</span>
                                    <span class="dcrs-plate__row">GAS REFILL FROM</span>
                                    <span class="dcrs-plate__row">AL SATWA WORKSHOP</span>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- 3. PRICING AND COST FACTORS -------------------------------------->
        <section class="dcrs-section dcrs-section--tint" id="pricing">
            <div class="dcrs-container">
                <div class="dcrs-heading dcrs-heading--center">
                    <div class="dcrs-kicker">Fast and Affordable Pricing</div>
                    <h2 class="dcrs-heading__title">Car AC Repair &amp; Gas Refill Pricing Guide</h2>
                    <p class="dcrs-heading__sub">
                        Clear, transparent estimates before work begins. Prices vary by refrigerant specification (R134a vs. R1234yf), vehicle make, and system condition.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="dcrs-table-wrapper">
                    <table class="dcrs-pricing-table">
                        <thead>
                            <tr>
                                <th>Service / Repair</th>
                                <th>Starting Price</th>
                                <th>Inclusions &amp; Scope</th>
                            </tr>
                        </thead>
                        <tbody>
                            {pricingRows.map((r) => (
                                <tr>
                                    <td class="dcrs-table-service">{r.service}</td>
                                    <td class="dcrs-table-price">{r.price}</td>
                                    <td class="dcrs-table-includes">{r.includes}</td>
                                </tr>
                            ))}
                        </tbody>
                    </table>
                </div>

                <p class="dcrs-pricing-disclaimer">
