                        </p>

                        <div class="dcrs-gas-cards">
                            <div class="dcrs-gas-card">
                                <div class="dcrs-gas-card__header">
                                    <h3 class="dcrs-gas-card__title">AC Compressor &amp; Magnetic Clutch</h3>
                                </div>
                                <p class="dcrs-gas-card__desc">
                                    We inspect compressor clutch engagement, test electrical feeds, and install OEM or manufacturer-compatible replacement compressors when a unit suffers internal failure.
                                </p>
                            </div>
                            <div class="dcrs-gas-card">
                                <div class="dcrs-gas-card__header">
                                    <h3 class="dcrs-gas-card__title">Condenser &amp; Cooling Fan Assembly</h3>
                                </div>
                                <p class="dcrs-gas-card__desc">
                                    We inspect the front-mounted condenser for physical damage, fin blockage, and refrigerant leaks, while testing cooling fan motors and relays to ensure proper heat dissipation.
                                </p>
                            </div>
                            <div class="dcrs-gas-card">
                                <div class="dcrs-gas-card__header">
                                    <h3 class="dcrs-gas-card__title">Evaporator Core &amp; Expansion Valve</h3>
                                </div>
                                <p class="dcrs-gas-card__desc">
                                    We diagnose in-cabin refrigerant leaks, replace faulty expansion valves that restrict refrigerant metering, and replace cabin air filters to maintain healthy cabin airflow.
                                </p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- 6. SIGNS YOU NEED THIS SERVICE ----------------------------------->
